      "locator": "Section 1 - Entity definition",
      "interpretation": "FIXTURE. Under Fixture Classifier first edition, GENEA mutation defines Fixture Entity One, recorded here as AML, where blasts are at least 20 per cent; 10 to 19 per cent blasts are assigned to Fixture Entity Two, recorded as MDS/AML. The criterion is defeated where a fixture-defining fusion is present. The source does not specify applicability to therapy-related disease.",
